WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,460
Was it that kid Wu Yang who said that?

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:05,590
Can she not tell the difference?

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:09,180
Jiaojiao and Youyou, yes

4
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,420
Youyou just came from the countryside yesterday

5
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,260
How could it be possible to save Wu Yang?

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,700
Could it be that Wu Yang kid made a mistake?

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:19,980
I heard that she is not very good at communicating with people Mr. Pei

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,820
Our Wuyang is not blind

9
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,260
Not even a fool.

10
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,490
Who said Wu Yang was alone yesterday?

11
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:27,130
Our entire Yin family

12
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,330
They are all eyewitnesses

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,690
What the hell is going on

14
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,840
There were guests at home yesterday

15
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,840
We drank tea in the back garden

16
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,640
Wu Yijian discovered that Wu Yang ran out of the room

17
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,200
Stand under the wind

18
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,640
It's too late for the adults to rush over.

19
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,960
Fortunately, Yoyo passed by on a wolfdog.

20
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,880
Grab Wu Yang and run away

21
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,960
The two fell into a puddle on the way

22
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,180
That kid Wu Yang doesn’t know how to dodge

23
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,580
If it weren't for Yoyo

24
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,540
I can't even imagine what the consequences will be.

25
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:57,460
Yesterday when Miss Youyou appeared

26
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,820
get dirty

27
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,740
Or did my aunt wash her early?

28
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:03,430
old gentleman old lady

29
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,270
Didn't you ask Yuyou yesterday?

30
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:10,730
It’s been so long since I’ve been here, why haven’t I seen Youyou? We want to see her and laugh.

31
00:01:11,090 --> 00:01:13,090
We were afraid that she would be a newborn baby when she first arrived.

32
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:16,370
So she asked Mu Ye to play with her, Old Chen

33
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:18,850
Why don't you go and invite the young lady over?

34
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:23,250
I always wanted to have a daughter

35
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:24,850
It's a pity that I couldn't do it

36
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:28,740
Yesterday, I only spoke a few words to Youyou.

37
00:01:29,370 --> 00:01:30,570
But I fell in love with it at first sight

38
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:33,010
Hello, uncle, mommy, this soft and cute little boy

39
00:01:33,090 --> 00:01:34,370
Have you eaten?

40
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:37,210
Yoyo, you are so cute

41
00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:40,170
Meet uncle, you are cute too

42
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:43,180
you are so beautiful
